WEBVTT

00:07:26.962 --> 00:07:30.138
an eight-year-old girl
could be married to a 30-year-old man.

00:07:30.686 --> 00:07:32.091
That can no longer happen.

00:07:32.115 --> 00:07:34.472
In 2016, the Children Act
made that illegal

00:07:34.496 --> 00:07:37.115
and set the minimum age of marriage at 18.

00:07:37.139 --> 00:07:39.369
That's the I of INSPIRE:

00:07:39.393 --> 00:07:41.784
enact and implement legislation.

00:07:43.058 --> 00:07:45.874
Cambodia is rolling out parental support,

00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:48.280
parent and caregiver support
across the country,

00:07:48.304 --> 00:07:51.145
so parents are equipped
to raise their children

00:07:51.169 --> 00:07:55.180
and to have discipline
in a nonviolent way in the home.

00:07:55.204 --> 00:07:56.752
That's the P of INSPIRE,

00:07:56.776 --> 00:07:58.529
parent and caregiver support.

00:07:58.553 --> 00:07:59.712
In the Philippines,

00:07:59.736 --> 00:08:03.545
there are 100 centers set up
to protect women and children nationwide.